    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d684">

                <pb facs="0665" n="499" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg499"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Swenson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-11-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 26, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I would advise you to accept clause Article I beginning “no responsibility”, and
                    to reject concluding part from “with a view”. Further delay dangerous owing to
                    attitude of Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Swenson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
